&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer, you&#39;ll build agentic systems from idea through production. The work starts with understanding the problem well enough to know what to build, then moves fast through prototyping and iteration. You&#39;ll design agent behavior, wire up tool integrations, tune evaluations until the AI actually works in practice. You&#39;ll sit close to the people who use what you build, and that feedback loop is how both the product and your skills grow fast. The team is new. Your work shapes what we ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role may require occasional work outside standard business hours to accommodate client time zones and up to 15% travel to client sites, including occasional overnight and multi-day engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
